   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M32

   1 a 0000 E46M32:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] RUNTIME, THE ROUTE-INTERFERENCE CONTROL: a multi-
   4 a 0006      item file PUT BETWEEN two console PUTs. E46L17 measured that ONE
   5 a 0006      file PUT between two console PUTs leaves SYSOUT's control block
   6 a 0006      intact; a MULTI-item statement is a longer stay inside the file
   7 a 0006      attach, so this asks whether the console still prints both of
   8 a 0006      its lines. */
   9 c 0006   dcl outf file, v char(20) varying, w char(20) varying;
  10 c 0006   v = 'CON';
  11 c 0013   w = 'AGAIN';
  12 c 0020   put list('FIRST');
  13 c 0037   open file(outf) stream output title('M32OUT DAT');
  14 c 0054   put file(outf) list(v,w);
  15 c 0075   close file(outf);
  16 c 007B   put list('SECOND');
  17 c 0092   stop;
  18 a 0095 end E46M32;

CODE SIZE = 0095
DATA AREA = 0047
FREE SYMS = 3824
END  COMPILATION
